weavec-bootstrap — Surface Weave Bootstrap Frontend
Copyright 2026 Jukka Aho

This product includes software developed as the deterministic bootstrap
frontend for the Weave programming language. It converts `.weave` surface
source to the stable `.wir` Weave Intermediate Representation and is itself
written in WIR.

The repository was formerly named `weavefront`.

This repository consumes published `weavec1` SDK archives. `weavec0` remains
in the historical compiler chain and is not a build input here.

Upstream:    https://github.com/ahojukka5/weavec-bootstrap
Dependency:  https://github.com/ahojukka5/weavec1  (Stage 1 compiler SDK)
Downstream:  https://github.com/ahojukka5/weavec   (self-hosted compiler)
